     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "A decrease in TSH level would indicate an improvement in the client’s hypothyroidism management, while improved blood glucose control would reflect better management of her type 2 diabetes. These outcomes would demonstrate the effectiveness of the care plan in addressing her endocrine health concerns."
